      "text": "(peaceful music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 7.64,
      "e": 9.95,
      "text": "- We are at the Butte County fairgrounds in Gridley,"
    },
    {
      "s": 9.95,
      "e": 13.75,
      "text": "and taking care of about 260 animals."
    },
    {
      "s": 13.75,
      "e": 16.01,
      "text": "The really rewarding part is when we get"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.01,
      "e": 17.89,
      "text": "to send animals home with their owners."
    },
    {
      "s": 17.89,
      "e": 19.34,
      "text": "- We came here to help"
    },
    {
      "s": 19.34,
      "e": 23.55,
      "text": "the animal disaster group, with the animals."
    },
    {
      "s": 23.55,
      "e": 26.26,
      "text": "We feed the dogs every day and we walk them,"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.26,
      "e": 29.92,
      "text": "and we have dogs, cats and then exotic animals."
    },
    {
      "s": 29.92,
      "e": 34.16,
      "text": "Chickens, birds and we're helping them reunite"
    },
    {
      "s": 34.16,
      "e": 36.02,
      "text": "with their homes, with their owners,"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.02,
      "e": 38.13,
      "text": "and tracking down who their owners are."
    },
    {
      "s": 38.13,
      "e": 40.71,
      "text": "And if we don't know who their owners are,"
    },
    {
      "s": 40.71,
      "e": 43.13,
      "text": "we're helping them find fosters,"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.13,
      "e": 45.34,
      "text": "so that the animals have a place to go"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.34,
      "e": 47.15,
      "text": "when this place shuts down."
    },
    {
      "s": 47.15,
      "e": 48.38,
      "text": "This is Molly."
    },
    {
      "s": 48.38,
      "e": 51.03,
      "text": "She is actually owned, but I'm fostering her."
    },
    {
      "s": 52.17,
      "e": 54.88,
      "text": "Her owners lost their house in the fire,"
    },
    {
      "s": 54.88,
      "e": 57.28,
      "text": "so I offered to foster her"
    },
    {
      "s": 57.28,
      "e": 58.73,
      "text": "until they get back on their feet."
    },
    {
      "s": 58.73,
      "e": 60.65,
      "text": "- This is the first time the California Guard's"
    },
    {
      "s": 60.65,
      "e": 64.3,
      "text": "done anything like this, so it's actually"
    },
    {
      "s": 64.3,
      "e": 67.8,
      "text": "really awesome to be a part of something new like this,"
    },
    {
      "s": 67.8,
      "e": 71.59,
      "text": "and being able to kind of internalize"
    },
    {
      "s": 71.59,
      "e": 74.66,
      "text": "some of the lessons learned, and prepare"
    },
    {
      "s": 74.66,
      "e": 76.82,
      "text": "for future disasters of this sort."
    },
    {
      "s": 76.82,
      "e": 80.4,
      "text": "- In the beginning, they send us to different rooms,"
    },
    {
      "s": 80.4,
      "e": 83.95,
      "text": "and in the morning we give them a morning feed"
    },
    {
      "s": 83.95,
      "e": 87.89,
      "text": "and clean their cages, and after all of the cages"
    },
    {
      "s": 87.89,
      "e": 90.0,
      "text": "were cleaned and in some of the rooms, it was,"
    },
    {
      "s": 90.0,
      "e": 93.09,
      "text": "in the first room I was in, it was 96 cages in it."
    },
    {
      "s": 93.09,
      "e": 96.51,
      "text": "And it took a while to clean all of them"
    },
    {
      "s": 96.51,
      "e": 97.64,
      "text": "and to get them all fed."
    },
    {
      "s": 97.64,
      "e": 99.29,
      "text": "I didn't really realize how important"
    },
    {
      "s": 99.29,
      "e": 101.97,
      "text": "that all of them got loved everyday,"
    },
    {
      "s": 101.97,
      "e": 104.1,
      "text": "and I kind of favored one for a while,"
    },
    {
      "s": 104.1,
      "e": 107.86,
      "text": "and then I realized all of them needed love, so."
    },
    {
      "s": 107.86,
      "e": 109.49,
      "text": "And then we do another feed at 3 o'clock"
    },
    {
      "s": 109.49,
      "e": 112.21,
      "text": "and then more loving and cleaning."
    },
    {
      "s": 112.21,
      "e": 114.96,
